  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国深秋最惊艳的大地奇观是哪一处吗？上集，咱们聊了盘锦红海滩、呼伦贝尔草原、光雾山红叶、鹅济那胡杨、长白山天池这集直接揭开谜底，看看前五名惊艳到什么程度。尤其是排在榜首的那处奇观，碧绿的冰川融水会泛起淡淡的奶白色，漫山白桦，画倒映在湖底，宛如金色绸缎。话不多说，茶给您沏好了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲。第五名，云南原阳哈尼梯田哀牢山深处。这个您可能在照片里见过，可照片里的他只是一小脚哈尼族人。在这座大山里，一锄头，一锄头，刻了整整一千三百角。十几万亩梯田。从山脚一层一层垒到云里头，山顶是森林，山腰是村寨，山下是梯田，水从林子里流下来，穿过村子灌进田里，再征成云。回到山上一圈一圈儿从没断过。深秋收完了稻子，整座山开始放水万千块梯田一下子变成了镜子。年轻晨站在观景台上，雾从谷底往上爬，太阳一露头，满天的朝霞全掉进了田里，千年手艺换来大山一身澄澈。您说这是不是洗尽千华后最好看的样子？第四名，云南腾冲江东银杏村高黎贡山脚下。如果说天地造化让人震撼，那这里就是全中国深秋最温润的人间烟火。在高丽贡山脚下，三万多株古银杏树掩映着一处用黑色火山石砌成的百年古村落，一入深秋，金黄的落叶如飞絮，细雨般随风飘洒，铺满了青石板路、矮矮的火山、石墙以及厚重的瓦屋顶。村里的老人们围坐在洒满碎金的石桌旁，烤火烹茶土灶台里柴火正旺，屋顶炊烟袅袅升起。您若是走累了，跨进小院坐下，脚踩着松软温润的金色落叶，端起一杯滚烫的热茶，满身的寒气与疲惫，瞬间化解在阳光里。安宁平静的小日子原是人间最深沉的经验。第三名，西藏林芝雅鲁藏布大峡谷，南加巴瓦峰脚下。他是世界第一大峡谷，长五百多公里，最深处六千多米，四座泰山摞起来才够得着。雅鲁藏布江绕着南加巴瓦拐的一个大弯儿，硬生生把大山劈出一道裂缝。深秋，江水碧绿，德相翡翠两岸落叶松金黄，枫叶火红晴天的傍晚七千七百多米的南加巴瓦，终年积雪的封顶被夕阳一点。整个烧成的金色，这就是日照金山。金光落进碧绿的江水里，您站在江边脚下，江声轰鸣，抬头是雪峰，人小的像一粒沙，心里反倒静了下来。面对这样的天地，造化，什么烦恼都不值一提，剩下的只有敬畏。第二名，四川九寨沟五花海与近海诗人看秋天全在抬眼看岸上，唯独九寨沟看在清澈见底的深潭水底。深秋时节，漫山遍野五彩斑斓的彩林与初雪覆盖的山头，被五花海、静海那宝石蓝与翡翠绿的盖花湖泊完完整整拓印下来。由于湖水极其纯净，钙化的枯木沉在水底，化作玉树琼枝，水底的世界甚至比岸上的山林还要斑斓奇绝。水在林中静静流淌，林在水底缓缓摇曳。您沿着湖边木栈道慢慢走，微风吹起水面的淡淡涟漪，整座秋天的绚烂，最终安然自若的沉淀。在碧水深处，您说这算不算最高的从容？那第一名到底是哪儿？先别急，聊到这儿，我先唠几句心里话。我发现经常有朋友留言说，年轻时候忙，没空出门。现在退休有空了，想去走走，可不知道先去哪儿去了，看什么。还有朋友说身子骨不比从前，哪这些地方海拔高上去就头晕气短，有没有不用往高处跑，也能把他们看明白的办法。还有带孙子孙女的，想给孩子讲讲这些大地奇观是怎么来的。可自己也说不全。您看咱们这个年纪看景，不光都是图个热闹，更想知道这些大好河山到底是怎么长出来的。可这些东西在手机上画完就忘上网，查一堆乱七八糟的翻大布头，又看的眼睛疼。前阵子我翻到一本书，正好解决这个问题，叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方。他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，分成五块自然奇观，文明印记、烟火人间秘境，寻踪人间天堂。咱们今天聊的这些，说到底是同一类风景大地的秋色。书里头一个地方接一个地方，讲这一类风景背后藏着些什么说法？这些颜色是怎么来的？为什么同是一个秋天各处又各不相同。几分钟一个地方讲的明明白白，图印的特别透亮一页。翻开就是一幅大画，我自己是这么用的，能去的地方出门前翻一翻到了地方，心里有底，看的就不只是一片颜色，而是背后的故事。暂时去不了的，就着图文慢慢看，也算去过了。摆在茶几上，孙辈来了，翻两页，长见识不说，写作文也正好用得上。老两口晚上翻番商量明年去哪儿比刷手机舒坦多了，房子会旧积蓄会花完，可装在心里的山河眼界传几辈人都贬不了值。这是咱们中国人代代相传的精神。家底一旦断了，可就不好接了，趁现在还能买到给自己，也给下一代备一份书。就在左下角的商品里，感兴趣的老朋友点进去看看，人暂时走不出去，咱先把大好河山装进屋里，好说回正题，第一名。新疆喀纳斯湖与和睦阿尔泰山深处是什么？是他前面九处，各有各的绝活，有的红的浓，有的金的亮，有的道营美喀纳斯不一样，他要的是全他在祖国最西北是中国唯一一汇进北冰洋的水系。湖面海拔一千三百多米，最深处一百八十多米，四周全是冰川雪山。每年九月下旬到十月初，就这短短十来天，冰川融水带着细细的矿物质，流进湖里整片湖水，先变成天青色，再变成奶白色。像有人往湖里倒了一整缸牛奶，月亮湾卧龙湾两岸数万亩白桦林，同时烧成了纯金金黄的树影，落进清白的水里，一边是火，一边是兵。清晨，白沙似的雾贴着水面慢慢飘，远处雪峰一排排立着到了和睦。图瓦人的木屋顶上青烟，一缕一缕往上升，您站在湖边。风是凉的，空气是甜的大半辈子，攒下的疲惫和烦恼，被这一整片山水涤荡的干干净净。水山啊，树，你大自然关于秋天的所有想象，全在这儿一样都没落下。前面比的是谁更红谁更精。他比的是谁把秋天装的最满十处。深秋奇观讲完了盘锦的简蓬草，在盐碱滩里熬出百里红毯。呼伦贝尔把整座草原铺成，金色大海，光暮山八百里红叶烧成了火浪。额济纳的胡杨在荒漠中璀璨。千年长白山天池，把初雪、金华和墨兰的湖水摆进同一个画面，元阳的梯田，把漫天朝霞装进的千万面镜子。银杏村把金色落叶、融进人间烟火大峡谷，让日照金山同矿、翡翠、江水九寨沟，让整片丘陵长在了水底。可只有喀纳斯湖能将冰川的乳白、白化的纯金、晨雾的空灵与雪山的巍峨，在十多天里淬炼成洗涤人间灵魂的终极画卷。最惊艳的秋天不是红的，最劣，也不是金的，最亮，是看一眼心里就宽的。最后问问您，这十处深丘奇观，您去过几处最想去的是哪一处？评论区告诉我，刚才说的那本大美中国左下方商品里就有爱看大美山河的朋友别错过，觉得这期让您长了见识，就转给身边跟您一样爱看大美山河的人，想听更多中华大地的地理传奇。点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00001",
      "start_ms": 290,
      "end_ms": 4890,
      "text": "您知道中国深秋最惊艳的大地奇观是哪一处吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5270,
      "end_ms": 5750,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5750,
      "end_ms": 16610,
      "text": "咱们聊了盘锦红海滩、呼伦贝尔草原、光雾山红叶、鹅济那胡杨、长白山天池这集直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00004",
      "start_ms": 17070,
      "end_ms": 19790,
      "text": "看看前五名惊艳到什么程度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00005",
      "start_ms": 20170,
      "end_ms": 22650,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那处奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00006",
      "start_ms": 23510,
      "end_ms": 27930,
      "text": "碧绿的冰川融水会泛起淡淡的奶白色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00007",
      "start_ms": 28790,
      "end_ms": 29850,
      "text": "漫山白桦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00008",
      "start_ms": 30180,
      "end_ms": 31420,
      "text": "画倒映在湖底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00009",
      "start_ms": 31580,
      "end_ms": 33400,
      "text": "宛如金色绸缎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00010",
      "start_ms": 33860,
      "end_ms": 34600,
      "text": "话不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00011",
      "start_ms": 35000,
      "end_ms": 36340,
      "text": "茶给您沏好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00012",
      "start_ms": 36540,
      "end_ms": 38660,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00013",
      "start_ms": 38960,
      "end_ms": 39980,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00014",
      "start_ms": 40280,
      "end_ms": 40940,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00015",
      "start_ms": 41640,
      "end_ms": 45260,
      "text": "云南原阳哈尼梯田哀牢山深处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00016",
      "start_ms": 46139,
      "end_ms": 48120,
      "text": "这个您可能在照片里见过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00017",
      "start_ms": 48660,
      "end_ms": 52520,
      "text": "可照片里的他只是一小脚哈尼族人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00018",
      "start_ms": 52520,
      "end_ms": 53560,
      "text": "在这座大山里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54140,
      "end_ms": 54940,
      "text": "一锄头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00020",
      "start_ms": 54960,
      "end_ms": 55540,
      "text": "一锄头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00021",
      "start_ms": 55640,
      "end_ms": 57520,
      "text": "刻了整整一千三百角。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00022",
      "start_ms": 58220,
      "end_ms": 59795,
      "text": "十几万亩梯田。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00023",
      "start_ms": 60530,
      "end_ms": 63305,
      "text": "从山脚一层一层垒到云里头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00024",
      "start_ms": 63690,
      "end_ms": 65085,
      "text": "山顶是森林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00025",
      "start_ms": 65500,
      "end_ms": 66760,
      "text": "山腰是村寨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00026",
      "start_ms": 67060,
      "end_ms": 68425,
      "text": "山下是梯田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00027",
      "start_ms": 69040,
      "end_ms": 70860,
      "text": "水从林子里流下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00028",
      "start_ms": 71280,
      "end_ms": 73455,
      "text": "穿过村子灌进田里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00029",
      "start_ms": 73800,
      "end_ms": 74760,
      "text": "再征成云。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00030",
      "start_ms": 74900,
      "end_ms": 78575,
      "text": "回到山上一圈一圈儿从没断过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00031",
      "start_ms": 78970,
      "end_ms": 80545,
      "text": "深秋收完了稻子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00032",
      "start_ms": 81000,
      "end_ms": 86775,
      "text": "整座山开始放水万千块梯田一下子变成了镜子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00033",
      "start_ms": 87500,
      "end_ms": 89735,
      "text": "年轻晨站在观景台上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00034",
      "start_ms": 90190,
      "end_ms": 91910,
      "text": "雾从谷底往上爬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00035",
      "start_ms": 92310,
      "end_ms": 93565,
      "text": "太阳一露头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00036",
      "start_ms": 93990,
      "end_ms": 96705,
      "text": "满天的朝霞全掉进了田里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00037",
      "start_ms": 97190,
      "end_ms": 101085,
      "text": "千年手艺换来大山一身澄澈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00038",
      "start_ms": 101840,
      "end_ms": 105755,
      "text": "您说这是不是洗尽千华后最好看的样子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00039",
      "start_ms": 106100,
      "end_ms": 106895,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00040",
      "start_ms": 107240,
      "end_ms": 111335,
      "text": "云南腾冲江东银杏村高黎贡山脚下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00041",
      "start_ms": 111960,
      "end_ms": 114120,
      "text": "如果说天地造化让人震撼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00042",
      "start_ms": 114340,
      "end_ms": 118725,
      "text": "那这里就是全中国深秋最温润的人间烟火。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00043",
      "start_ms": 119190,
      "end_ms": 120845,
      "text": "在高丽贡山脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00044",
      "start_ms": 121340,
      "end_ms": 128605,
      "text": "三万多株古银杏树掩映着一处用黑色火山石砌成的百年古村落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00045",
      "start_ms": 129020,
      "end_ms": 130025,
      "text": "一入深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00046",
      "start_ms": 130610,
      "end_ms": 133050,
      "text": "金黄的落叶如飞絮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00047",
      "start_ms": 133190,
      "end_ms": 135085,
      "text": "细雨般随风飘洒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00048",
      "start_ms": 135640,
      "end_ms": 142045,
      "text": "铺满了青石板路、矮矮的火山、石墙以及厚重的瓦屋顶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00049",
      "start_ms": 142490,
      "end_ms": 146290,
      "text": "村里的老人们围坐在洒满碎金的石桌旁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00050",
      "start_ms": 146470,
      "end_ms": 150325,
      "text": "烤火烹茶土灶台里柴火正旺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00051",
      "start_ms": 150730,
      "end_ms": 152675,
      "text": "屋顶炊烟袅袅升起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00052",
      "start_ms": 153090,
      "end_ms": 154250,
      "text": "您若是走累了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00053",
      "start_ms": 154290,
      "end_ms": 155765,
      "text": "跨进小院坐下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00054",
      "start_ms": 156240,
      "end_ms": 159115,
      "text": "脚踩着松软温润的金色落叶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00055",
      "start_ms": 159500,
      "end_ms": 161300,
      "text": "端起一杯滚烫的热茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00056",
      "start_ms": 161840,
      "end_ms": 163680,
      "text": "满身的寒气与疲惫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00057",
      "start_ms": 163880,
      "end_ms": 165695,
      "text": "瞬间化解在阳光里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00058",
      "start_ms": 166340,
      "end_ms": 170735,
      "text": "安宁平静的小日子原是人间最深沉的经验。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00059",
      "start_ms": 171100,
      "end_ms": 171740,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00060",
      "start_ms": 172100,
      "end_ms": 174345,
      "text": "西藏林芝雅鲁藏布大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00061",
      "start_ms": 174680,
      "end_ms": 176375,
      "text": "南加巴瓦峰脚下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00062",
      "start_ms": 176830,
      "end_ms": 178455,
      "text": "他是世界第一大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00063",
      "start_ms": 178690,
      "end_ms": 179835,
      "text": "长五百多公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00064",
      "start_ms": 180260,
      "end_ms": 182165,
      "text": "最深处六千多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00065",
      "start_ms": 182540,
      "end_ms": 185225,
      "text": "四座泰山摞起来才够得着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00066",
      "start_ms": 185700,
      "end_ms": 188740,
      "text": "雅鲁藏布江绕着南加巴瓦拐的一个大弯儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00067",
      "start_ms": 189390,
      "end_ms": 192345,
      "text": "硬生生把大山劈出一道裂缝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00068",
      "start_ms": 192800,
      "end_ms": 193445,
      "text": "深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00069",
      "start_ms": 194000,
      "end_ms": 195165,
      "text": "江水碧绿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00070",
      "start_ms": 195550,
      "end_ms": 199585,
      "text": "德相翡翠两岸落叶松金黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00071",
      "start_ms": 200000,
      "end_ms": 205565,
      "text": "枫叶火红晴天的傍晚七千七百多米的南加巴瓦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00072",
      "start_ms": 206000,
      "end_ms": 209085,
      "text": "终年积雪的封顶被夕阳一点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00073",
      "start_ms": 209460,
      "end_ms": 211445,
      "text": "整个烧成的金色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00074",
      "start_ms": 211900,
      "end_ms": 213255,
      "text": "这就是日照金山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00075",
      "start_ms": 214220,
      "end_ms": 216645,
      "text": "金光落进碧绿的江水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00076",
      "start_ms": 217360,
      "end_ms": 219770,
      "text": "您站在江边脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00077",
      "start_ms": 219910,
      "end_ms": 220985,
      "text": "江声轰鸣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00078",
      "start_ms": 221740,
      "end_ms": 223125,
      "text": "抬头是雪峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00079",
      "start_ms": 223690,
      "end_ms": 225475,
      "text": "人小的像一粒沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00080",
      "start_ms": 226220,
      "end_ms": 228235,
      "text": "心里反倒静了下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00081",
      "start_ms": 228740,
      "end_ms": 230120,
      "text": "面对这样的天地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00082",
      "start_ms": 230120,
      "end_ms": 230580,
      "text": "造化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00083",
      "start_ms": 230860,
      "end_ms": 232305,
      "text": "什么烦恼都不值一提，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00084",
      "start_ms": 232900,
      "end_ms": 234405,
      "text": "剩下的只有敬畏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00085",
      "start_ms": 234760,
      "end_ms": 235455,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00086",
      "start_ms": 235910,
      "end_ms": 242475,
      "text": "四川九寨沟五花海与近海诗人看秋天全在抬眼看岸上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00087",
      "start_ms": 242990,
      "end_ms": 247425,
      "text": "唯独九寨沟看在清澈见底的深潭水底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00088",
      "start_ms": 247860,
      "end_ms": 248815,
      "text": "深秋时节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00089",
      "start_ms": 249240,
      "end_ms": 253575,
      "text": "漫山遍野五彩斑斓的彩林与初雪覆盖的山头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00090",
      "start_ms": 254060,
      "end_ms": 261505,
      "text": "被五花海、静海那宝石蓝与翡翠绿的盖花湖泊完完整整拓印下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00091",
      "start_ms": 261960,
      "end_ms": 264075,
      "text": "由于湖水极其纯净，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00092",
      "start_ms": 264520,
      "end_ms": 266705,
      "text": "钙化的枯木沉在水底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00093",
      "start_ms": 267120,
      "end_ms": 268795,
      "text": "化作玉树琼枝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00094",
      "start_ms": 269260,
      "end_ms": 273575,
      "text": "水底的世界甚至比岸上的山林还要斑斓奇绝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00095",
      "start_ms": 273990,
      "end_ms": 275890,
      "text": "水在林中静静流淌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00096",
      "start_ms": 276310,
      "end_ms": 278405,
      "text": "林在水底缓缓摇曳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00097",
      "start_ms": 278860,
      "end_ms": 281105,
      "text": "您沿着湖边木栈道慢慢走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00098",
      "start_ms": 281510,
      "end_ms": 284345,
      "text": "微风吹起水面的淡淡涟漪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00099",
      "start_ms": 285040,
      "end_ms": 286840,
      "text": "整座秋天的绚烂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00100",
      "start_ms": 286940,
      "end_ms": 289040,
      "text": "最终安然自若的沉淀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00101",
      "start_ms": 289080,
      "end_ms": 290335,
      "text": "在碧水深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00102",
      "start_ms": 290810,
      "end_ms": 292635,
      "text": "您说这算不算最高的从容？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00103",
      "start_ms": 293010,
      "end_ms": 294755,
      "text": "那第一名到底是哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00104",
      "start_ms": 295390,
      "end_ms": 296315,
      "text": "先别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00105",
      "start_ms": 297060,
      "end_ms": 297895,
      "text": "聊到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00106",
      "start_ms": 298190,
      "end_ms": 300005,
      "text": "我先唠几句心里话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00107",
      "start_ms": 300360,
      "end_ms": 303490,
      "text": "我发现经常有朋友留言说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00108",
      "start_ms": 303630,
      "end_ms": 304630,
      "text": "年轻时候忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00109",
      "start_ms": 304950,
      "end_ms": 305955,
      "text": "没空出门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00110",
      "start_ms": 306780,
      "end_ms": 308400,
      "text": "现在退休有空了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00111",
      "start_ms": 308620,
      "end_ms": 309540,
      "text": "想去走走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00112",
      "start_ms": 310200,
      "end_ms": 312440,
      "text": "可不知道先去哪儿去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00113",
      "start_ms": 312440,
      "end_ms": 313140,
      "text": "看什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00114",
      "start_ms": 313560,
      "end_ms": 316360,
      "text": "还有朋友说身子骨不比从前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00115",
      "start_ms": 316420,
      "end_ms": 320800,
      "text": "哪这些地方海拔高上去就头晕气短，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00116",
      "start_ms": 321300,
      "end_ms": 323300,
      "text": "有没有不用往高处跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00117",
      "start_ms": 323640,
      "end_ms": 325760,
      "text": "也能把他们看明白的办法。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00118",
      "start_ms": 326240,
      "end_ms": 327920,
      "text": "还有带孙子孙女的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00119",
      "start_ms": 328140,
      "end_ms": 331680,
      "text": "想给孩子讲讲这些大地奇观是怎么来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00120",
      "start_ms": 331860,
      "end_ms": 333060,
      "text": "可自己也说不全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00121",
      "start_ms": 333440,
      "end_ms": 335880,
      "text": "您看咱们这个年纪看景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00122",
      "start_ms": 335980,
      "end_ms": 337750,
      "text": "不光都是图个热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00123",
      "start_ms": 338290,
      "end_ms": 343090,
      "text": "更想知道这些大好河山到底是怎么长出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00124",
      "start_ms": 343390,
      "end_ms": 346550,
      "text": "可这些东西在手机上画完就忘上网，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00125",
      "start_ms": 346570,
      "end_ms": 349250,
      "text": "查一堆乱七八糟的翻大布头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00126",
      "start_ms": 349550,
      "end_ms": 350750,
      "text": "又看的眼睛疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00127",
      "start_ms": 351110,
      "end_ms": 352650,
      "text": "前阵子我翻到一本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00128",
      "start_ms": 353150,
      "end_ms": 354690,
      "text": "正好解决这个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00129",
      "start_ms": 355050,
      "end_ms": 359770,
      "text": "叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00130",
      "start_ms": 360190,
      "end_ms": 364150,
      "text": "他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00131",
      "start_ms": 364510,
      "end_ms": 366840,
      "text": "分成五块自然奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00132",
      "start_ms": 367220,
      "end_ms": 370480,
      "text": "文明印记、烟火人间秘境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00133",
      "start_ms": 370500,
      "end_ms": 372385,
      "text": "寻踪人间天堂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00134",
      "start_ms": 372810,
      "end_ms": 374305,
      "text": "咱们今天聊的这些，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00135",
      "start_ms": 374890,
      "end_ms": 378735,
      "text": "说到底是同一类风景大地的秋色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00136",
      "start_ms": 379130,
      "end_ms": 380790,
      "text": "书里头一个地方接一个地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00137",
      "start_ms": 380790,
      "end_ms": 384375,
      "text": "讲这一类风景背后藏着些什么说法？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00138",
      "start_ms": 384940,
      "end_ms": 386905,
      "text": "这些颜色是怎么来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00139",
      "start_ms": 387500,
      "end_ms": 391545,
      "text": "为什么同是一个秋天各处又各不相同。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00140",
      "start_ms": 392240,
      "end_ms": 395265,
      "text": "几分钟一个地方讲的明明白白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00141",
      "start_ms": 395660,
      "end_ms": 398510,
      "text": "图印的特别透亮一页。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00142",
      "start_ms": 398510,
      "end_ms": 400555,
      "text": "翻开就是一幅大画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00143",
      "start_ms": 401170,
      "end_ms": 402845,
      "text": "我自己是这么用的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00144",
      "start_ms": 403390,
      "end_ms": 406790,
      "text": "能去的地方出门前翻一翻到了地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00145",
      "start_ms": 406790,
      "end_ms": 407635,
      "text": "心里有底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00146",
      "start_ms": 408140,
      "end_ms": 410625,
      "text": "看的就不只是一片颜色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00147",
      "start_ms": 411130,
      "end_ms": 412925,
      "text": "而是背后的故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00148",
      "start_ms": 413370,
      "end_ms": 414455,
      "text": "暂时去不了的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00149",
      "start_ms": 414760,
      "end_ms": 415905,
      "text": "就着图文慢慢看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00150",
      "start_ms": 416190,
      "end_ms": 417085,
      "text": "也算去过了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00151",
      "start_ms": 417590,
      "end_ms": 418685,
      "text": "摆在茶几上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00152",
      "start_ms": 419070,
      "end_ms": 419850,
      "text": "孙辈来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00153",
      "start_ms": 419850,
      "end_ms": 420515,
      "text": "翻两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00154",
      "start_ms": 420860,
      "end_ms": 421860,
      "text": "长见识不说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00155",
      "start_ms": 422160,
      "end_ms": 423980,
      "text": "写作文也正好用得上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00156",
      "start_ms": 424470,
      "end_ms": 429730,
      "text": "老两口晚上翻番商量明年去哪儿比刷手机舒坦多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00157",
      "start_ms": 430250,
      "end_ms": 432790,
      "text": "房子会旧积蓄会花完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00158",
      "start_ms": 433210,
      "end_ms": 438070,
      "text": "可装在心里的山河眼界传几辈人都贬不了值。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00159",
      "start_ms": 438530,
      "end_ms": 441530,
      "text": "这是咱们中国人代代相传的精神。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00160",
      "start_ms": 441530,
      "end_ms": 443810,
      "text": "家底一旦断了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00161",
      "start_ms": 444290,
      "end_ms": 445430,
      "text": "可就不好接了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00162",
      "start_ms": 445750,
      "end_ms": 448250,
      "text": "趁现在还能买到给自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00163",
      "start_ms": 448310,
      "end_ms": 450510,
      "text": "也给下一代备一份书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00164",
      "start_ms": 450570,
      "end_ms": 452850,
      "text": "就在左下角的商品里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00165",
      "start_ms": 453170,
      "end_ms": 455730,
      "text": "感兴趣的老朋友点进去看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00166",
      "start_ms": 456610,
      "end_ms": 458190,
      "text": "人暂时走不出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00167",
      "start_ms": 458650,
      "end_ms": 461430,
      "text": "咱先把大好河山装进屋里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00168",
      "start_ms": 461730,
      "end_ms": 463590,
      "text": "好说回正题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00169",
      "start_ms": 464450,
      "end_ms": 465090,
      "text": "第一名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00170",
      "start_ms": 465870,
      "end_ms": 471070,
      "text": "新疆喀纳斯湖与和睦阿尔泰山深处是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00171",
      "start_ms": 471070,
      "end_ms": 473330,
      "text": "是他前面九处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00172",
      "start_ms": 473650,
      "end_ms": 474890,
      "text": "各有各的绝活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00173",
      "start_ms": 475690,
      "end_ms": 476870,
      "text": "有的红的浓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00174",
      "start_ms": 477170,
      "end_ms": 478250,
      "text": "有的金的亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00175",
      "start_ms": 478570,
      "end_ms": 481470,
      "text": "有的道营美喀纳斯不一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00176",
      "start_ms": 481630,
      "end_ms": 488765,
      "text": "他要的是全他在祖国最西北是中国唯一一汇进北冰洋的水系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00177",
      "start_ms": 489500,
      "end_ms": 491515,
      "text": "湖面海拔一千三百多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00178",
      "start_ms": 491950,
      "end_ms": 493745,
      "text": "最深处一百八十多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00179",
      "start_ms": 494140,
      "end_ms": 496405,
      "text": "四周全是冰川雪山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00180",
      "start_ms": 496800,
      "end_ms": 499025,
      "text": "每年九月下旬到十月初，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00181",
      "start_ms": 499440,
      "end_ms": 500915,
      "text": "就这短短十来天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00182",
      "start_ms": 501250,
      "end_ms": 503990,
      "text": "冰川融水带着细细的矿物质，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00183",
      "start_ms": 503990,
      "end_ms": 506380,
      "text": "流进湖里整片湖水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00184",
      "start_ms": 506440,
      "end_ms": 507955,
      "text": "先变成天青色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00185",
      "start_ms": 508350,
      "end_ms": 509685,
      "text": "再变成奶白色。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00186",
      "start_ms": 510120,
      "end_ms": 512945,
      "text": "像有人往湖里倒了一整缸牛奶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00187",
      "start_ms": 513320,
      "end_ms": 517210,
      "text": "月亮湾卧龙湾两岸数万亩白桦林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00188",
      "start_ms": 517270,
      "end_ms": 520900,
      "text": "同时烧成了纯金金黄的树影，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00189",
      "start_ms": 521060,
      "end_ms": 522655,
      "text": "落进清白的水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00190",
      "start_ms": 523090,
      "end_ms": 524125,
      "text": "一边是火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00191",
      "start_ms": 524490,
      "end_ms": 525365,
      "text": "一边是兵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00192",
      "start_ms": 525760,
      "end_ms": 526200,
      "text": "清晨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00193",
      "start_ms": 526560,
      "end_ms": 529675,
      "text": "白沙似的雾贴着水面慢慢飘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00194",
      "start_ms": 530110,
      "end_ms": 534035,
      "text": "远处雪峰一排排立着到了和睦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00195",
      "start_ms": 534320,
      "end_ms": 537010,
      "text": "图瓦人的木屋顶上青烟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00196",
      "start_ms": 537150,
      "end_ms": 538685,
      "text": "一缕一缕往上升，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00197",
      "start_ms": 539080,
      "end_ms": 540200,
      "text": "您站在湖边。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00198",
      "start_ms": 540910,
      "end_ms": 542035,
      "text": "风是凉的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00199",
      "start_ms": 542510,
      "end_ms": 545340,
      "text": "空气是甜的大半辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00200",
      "start_ms": 545360,
      "end_ms": 547125,
      "text": "攒下的疲惫和烦恼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00201",
      "start_ms": 547490,
      "end_ms": 551305,
      "text": "被这一整片山水涤荡的干干净净。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00202",
      "start_ms": 551730,
      "end_ms": 553550,
      "text": "水山啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00203",
      "start_ms": 553660,
      "end_ms": 554025,
      "text": "树，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00204",
      "start_ms": 554450,
      "end_ms": 558105,
      "text": "你大自然关于秋天的所有想象，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00205",
      "start_ms": 558560,
      "end_ms": 560745,
      "text": "全在这儿一样都没落下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00206",
      "start_ms": 561540,
      "end_ms": 564535,
      "text": "前面比的是谁更红谁更精。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00207",
      "start_ms": 565360,
      "end_ms": 569430,
      "text": "他比的是谁把秋天装的最满十处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00208",
      "start_ms": 569470,
      "end_ms": 572760,
      "text": "深秋奇观讲完了盘锦的简蓬草，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00209",
      "start_ms": 572920,
      "end_ms": 575625,
      "text": "在盐碱滩里熬出百里红毯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00210",
      "start_ms": 576100,
      "end_ms": 578420,
      "text": "呼伦贝尔把整座草原铺成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00211",
      "start_ms": 578460,
      "end_ms": 579505,
      "text": "金色大海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00212",
      "start_ms": 579970,
      "end_ms": 582675,
      "text": "光暮山八百里红叶烧成了火浪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00213",
      "start_ms": 583180,
      "end_ms": 586140,
      "text": "额济纳的胡杨在荒漠中璀璨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00214",
      "start_ms": 586180,
      "end_ms": 588570,
      "text": "千年长白山天池，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00215",
      "start_ms": 588810,
      "end_ms": 593685,
      "text": "把初雪、金华和墨兰的湖水摆进同一个画面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00216",
      "start_ms": 594440,
      "end_ms": 595580,
      "text": "元阳的梯田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00217",
      "start_ms": 595580,
      "end_ms": 598515,
      "text": "把漫天朝霞装进的千万面镜子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00218",
      "start_ms": 599210,
      "end_ms": 604080,
      "text": "银杏村把金色落叶、融进人间烟火大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00219",
      "start_ms": 604080,
      "end_ms": 607770,
      "text": "让日照金山同矿、翡翠、江水九寨沟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00220",
      "start_ms": 607950,
      "end_ms": 610555,
      "text": "让整片丘陵长在了水底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00221",
      "start_ms": 611150,
      "end_ms": 619550,
      "text": "可只有喀纳斯湖能将冰川的乳白、白化的纯金、晨雾的空灵与雪山的巍峨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00222",
      "start_ms": 619850,
      "end_ms": 625465,
      "text": "在十多天里淬炼成洗涤人间灵魂的终极画卷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00223",
      "start_ms": 625950,
      "end_ms": 628830,
      "text": "最惊艳的秋天不是红的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00224",
      "start_ms": 628830,
      "end_ms": 629445,
      "text": "最劣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00225",
      "start_ms": 629860,
      "end_ms": 630900,
      "text": "也不是金的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00226",
      "start_ms": 630900,
      "end_ms": 631425,
      "text": "最亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00227",
      "start_ms": 631870,
      "end_ms": 634125,
      "text": "是看一眼心里就宽的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00228",
      "start_ms": 634650,
      "end_ms": 635525,
      "text": "最后问问您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00229",
      "start_ms": 636010,
      "end_ms": 637650,
      "text": "这十处深丘奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00230",
      "start_ms": 637650,
      "end_ms": 641100,
      "text": "您去过几处最想去的是哪一处？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00231",
      "start_ms": 641400,
      "end_ms": 642545,
      "text": "评论区告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00232",
      "start_ms": 642950,
      "end_ms": 651015,
      "text": "刚才说的那本大美中国左下方商品里就有爱看大美山河的朋友别错过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00233",
      "start_ms": 651610,
      "end_ms": 653885,
      "text": "觉得这期让您长了见识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00234",
      "start_ms": 654360,
      "end_ms": 658285,
      "text": "就转给身边跟您一样爱看大美山河的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00235",
      "start_ms": 658710,
      "end_ms": 661090,
      "text": "想听更多中华大地的地理传奇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00236",
      "start_ms": 661310,
      "end_ms": 662175,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ac516db0b5dced62_s00237",
      "start_ms": 662550,
      "end_ms": 663995,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
